# Vercel deployment input. The site is built by scripts/build_site.mjs (viewer + packs/).
# The full local API (api/app.py) is not deployed; the hosted engine is api/index.py. Its helper modules live beside
# it with a leading underscore (api/_*.py), which keeps Vercel from deploying them as functions of their own;
# tests/test_hosted_deploy.py checks that everything api/index.py imports reaches Vercel.
/api/app.py
/out
/.utilsim_cache
/.venv
/examples
/tests
/web
